%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#4285F4'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer as "Customer App"
    participant API as "Backend API"
    participant Firestore as "Firestore"
    participant FCM as "FCM"
    participant Razorpay as "Razorpay"

    Note over Customer,Firestore: Step 1: Browse & Select Service

    Customer->>API: GET /api/catalog-public/services
    API->>Firestore: Query Services collection
    Firestore->>API: Service tree (products, pricing)
    API-->>Customer: Service catalog

    Note over Customer,Firestore: Step 2: Create Booking

    Customer->>API: POST /api/bookings (service details, location, schedule)
    API->>Firestore: Create booking document
    API->>Firestore: Create job document (status: pending)
    API->>FCM: Send notification to employees (new job available)
    Firestore-->>API: Confirm writes
    API-->>Customer: Booking created (bookingId)

    Note over Customer,Razorpay: Step 3: Payment

    Customer->>API: POST /api/payments/razorpay/create-order (amount)
    API->>Firestore: Create pending payment record
    API-->>Customer: Razorpay order_id

    Customer->>Razorpay: Complete payment (card/UPI)
    Razorpay-->>Customer: Payment success

    Customer->>API: POST /api/payments/razorpay/verify (payment_id, order_id)
    API->>Razorpay: Verify payment signature
    Razorpay-->>API: Valid
    API->>Firestore: Update payment status to 'completed'
    API->>Firestore: Update booking status to 'confirmed'
    API->>Firestore: Update job status to 'assigned'
    API->>FCM: Notify customer: "Payment successful"
    API-->>Customer: Payment verified, booking confirmed

    Note over Customer,FCM: Step 4: Job Completion

    loop Employee works on job
        Employee->>API: POST /api/jobs/:id/pickup
        API->>Firestore: Update job status to 'assigned'
        API->>FCM: Notify customer: "Technician assigned"
    end

    loop Work completion
        Employee->>API: POST /api/photos/upload (job photos)
        Employee->>API: POST /api/jobs/:id/complete (notes, amount)
        API->>Firestore: Update job status to 'completed'
        API->>Firestore: Generate invoice
        API->>Firestore: Update booking status to 'completed'
        API->>FCM: Notify customer: "Job completed"
    end

    Note over Customer,API: Step 5: View Invoice

    Customer->>API: GET /api/bookings/:id
    API->>Firestore: Fetch booking + invoice
    Firestore-->>API: Invoice data
    API-->>Customer: Invoice (PDF URL, details)